@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #139D90
 LifeLineBorderColor #A5BFC2
 ParticipantBackgroundColor #183840
 ParticipantBorderColor #183840
 ParticipantFontColor white
 ActorBorderColor #183840
 ActorFontColor #183840
 GroupBorderColor #139D90
 GroupBackgroundColor #EAF6F3
 GroupHeaderFontColor #183840
 NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1E7
 NoteBorderColor #F66B22
}
actor Student
participant Frontend as FE
participant "REST Controller" as API
participant MatchingService as S
database PostgreSQL as DB
title Find compatible partners | US-06
Student -> FE: Search for partners
FE -> API: HTTPS GET /api/v1/matches?university=PW&subjectId={UUID}\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_token>
ref over FE, DB
matching_00_authentication: validate JWT, ACTIVE account, STUDENT role
end ref

API -> S: findPartners(verified sub, filters)
S -> DB: Load own profile and weekly slots
DB --> S: Profile + availability
alt profile incomplete or no availability
 S --> API: PROFILE_INCOMPLETE
 API --> FE: 409 Conflict + ErrorEnvelope
else ready to search
 S -> DB: Load ACTIVE STUDENT candidates with profiles / slots
 DB --> S: Candidate data
 S -> S: Exclude self; union overlapping slots; apply filters\nRequire shared subject + positive overlap\nScore descending, then UUID ascending
 S --> API: Results
 API --> FE: 200 OK + Results (items may be empty)
end
FE --> Student: Partners, empty state or setup prompt
note over API,S: Malformed query / UUID -> 400; unknown subject filter -> 422.
@enduml
